  "description": "Wedgetailed Eagle Nesting Habitat Low: LIST product `WEDGETAILED_EAGLE_NESTING_HABITAT_LOW`, statewide. 4,545,271 features, multi-polygon (EPSG:28355). Built from the 29 per-LGA LIST zips: features LIST clipped at LGA boundaries are rejoined to one row per `ID`, and an `lga` column names the source LGA(s); parts outside every LGA (over open water) are not in any LGA file. Source released 2024-01-10. Data (c) State of Tasmania, CC BY 3.0 AU: cite as \"Wedgetailed Eagle Nesting Habitat Low\" from theLIST (c) State of Tasmania.",
